{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_spot_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_spot_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"誰是英雄","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_spot_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"aa2371d70331dc0aabc679cdd07e7f01dc11052b58519a2d2403113cbceeb785","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斑點哥哥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斑點哥哥，我來還漫畫啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，門沒有鎖......斑點哥哥，不在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡自己把漫畫放回去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"糟、糟了，泡普卡把書架撞倒了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"得把書架立起來......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這麼多漫畫都掉在地上......不知道哪本該放在什麼地方......斑點哥哥，會生氣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"先把標題一樣的漫畫堆到一起，等斑點哥哥回來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？為什麼這本漫畫沒有標題？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"泡普卡從書堆中揀出一個格格不入的皮面本子。純色的封面上，除了灰塵什麼都沒有，沒有標題，沒有插畫，甚至連一個字都沒有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"這本漫畫該放哪一堆呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"泡普卡打開本子，紙張有點泛黃。上面倒也有漫畫，只不過那些線條顯然不是印刷的產物，而是某個人自己用筆劃下來的。\n雖然看起來不甚專業，漫畫的內容卻不是隨意塗鴉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我的膝蓋，我的腿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"博爾努，你就不能跟你爸說兩句好話，給我們換個好相處的長官嗎？跟我們一起在這練一個小時匍匐前進，好玩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"試過，沒用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"這個博爾努，長得和斑點哥哥好像！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡記得斑點哥哥的名字是叫......伯、博......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，伯克依·博爾努！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這裡，線條畫到框外去了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍息——立正！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看你們成什麼樣子？鬆鬆垮垮，站沒站相！前線的兄弟們每天流汗流血，你們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"居然還有人敢看什麼漫畫書——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——博爾努准將！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰看漫畫了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"報告，是伯克依·博爾努！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"泡普卡翻到下一頁，一個拉遠的鏡頭占了整整一頁：\n士兵博爾努在宿舍裡偷藏的漫畫被搜了出來，堆在軍營中央。\n在本子上畫漫畫的人細細地畫出了那些漫畫的封面、標題、冊數，筆觸很重，幾乎把紙劃破了。\n而周圍的人被他幾筆帶過，甚至顯得有些虛幻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全體都有——蹲下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博爾努，你不用蹲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你來把這些漫畫裡的台詞一句不落地讀一遍。你什麼時候讀完，他們什麼時候站起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"報告，博爾努准將，漫畫是我自己的，我可以自己蹲著讀......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不幹，他們就在這蹲到明天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就連這些胡編亂造的漫畫都知道，一個人至少應該對自己造出來的爛攤子負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"連這一點都做不到，你還好意思看什麼英雄漫畫？你想當英雄？你也配？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"青年把所有漫畫讀完，已經過了兩個小時。\n士兵們原本還有些同情他，但蹲了兩個小時之後，他們看青年的眼神裡只剩下怨懟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"看漫畫，是這麼壞的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"不，一定是博爾努的父親——一定是斑點哥哥的父親誤會了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"那件事之後，整支隊伍被送上前線。\n士兵們普遍覺得這是博爾努准將被兒子惹怒後的決定，士兵博爾努的處境越發難堪。\n終於，士兵博爾努選擇逃跑。\n他尚未逃出軍營就被巡邏兵抓住，敵人卻恰好在此時襲來。\n敵人的攻勢迅猛，本就士氣不振的軍隊瞬間被衝垮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這裡沒人，我們倆分頭跑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你那是什麼表情？難道你事到如今才想起來你有個將軍父親？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"我恨他。他侮辱我，貶低我，說我永遠成不了英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還猶豫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"可我不想事事順他的意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你發燒了？腦子被震壞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我真的在戰場上開溜，我的名字就會順理成章地變成逃兵的名字，被他掛在嘴邊，成為永遠的恥辱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，然後呢？難道你還真想當什麼英雄不成？先保住你自己那條小命吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"我也知道自己成不了英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"但我要是死了，那個老東西說不定會後悔，就算不後悔也無話可說；要是我活下來了，我要把他這些年嘲諷我的每一句話都原樣還回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是想跑就跑吧。這是我自己的事，我自己的家庭問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博爾努，出列！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為了表彰博爾努在上次戰鬥中做出的貢獻，特授予其二級英雄士兵獎章！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請博爾努自己朗讀嘉獎令內容！"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉甸甸的獎章掛在胸前，嘉獎令拿在手中。\n青年壓抑著洶湧的情感，在開始朗讀之前掃視下面的人群，其中沒有父親的身影。\n帶著半分遺憾和半分釋然，他讀了起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......特予嘉獎，此令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"准將，博爾努。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"博爾努......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡就知道，斑點哥哥的父親一定會和他和好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"泡普卡擦了擦眼睛，翻到下一頁，卻只看到一片空白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"後面沒有了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡，你在看什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，斑點哥哥，我不是故意把書架弄倒的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你當然不是故意的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你在看的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡好喜歡這本漫畫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"這本漫畫是斑點哥哥畫的自己的故事，對不對？泡普卡從來都不知道，原來斑點哥哥這麼厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"那個不是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知為何，這句話到了嘴邊，斑點卻說不出口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡，快到睡覺時間了，去找梓蘭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！明天還有例行訓練，梓蘭姐姐還在訓練之後安排了聚餐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"你不說我都忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"......斑點哥哥，生氣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有。跟月見夜我都沒生過氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"快回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斑點拿起本子，遲疑了片刻，轉頭整理起掉了滿地的漫畫。\n這些漫畫他瞭若指掌，他看一眼背面的插圖就知道這是哪個作者的哪一部漫畫的第幾冊。整理這些東西要不了多長時間。\n所有漫畫都歸位之後，斑點再次看向那個皮面本子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我得去跟泡普卡說一聲，讓她別把剛剛看的東西告訴別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼英雄啊，我早都死心了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"假如，至少在泡普卡他們面前，我能像個英雄一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"——不可能。我根本不是那塊料。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"聚餐，聚餐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，聚餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"（歎氣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧大家第二次實戰訓練的時候表現不錯，要不然聚餐可就泡湯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，為了不被杜賓教官留下加訓，我可是使出了渾身解數！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......七八成總是有的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"恕我直言，今天的例行訓練，大家的表現都堪稱完美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，如果要評選今天訓練中表現最好的一位，我只能當仁不讓、勉為其難，推薦我自己了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A6組員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，如此冷淡的反應，真是令人痛心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是你，斑點老兄，不打算對我完美的戰鬥發表一些意見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛在想事情，沒聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"多麼冷淡的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，月見夜，閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"（優雅地聳肩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我說實話，今天表現最好的其實是斑點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"今天第一次實戰時，斑點哥哥的動作怪怪的，好像要跟杜賓教官一對一戰鬥一樣，泡普卡有點擔心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"但第二次實戰就不一樣了！斑點哥哥的治療很及時，還幫泡普卡擋下了杜賓教官的攻擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"那一擋很關鍵的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到杜賓教官攻擊的角度就知道要糟，沒想到斑點像瞬間移動一樣頂上了那個位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是斑點補位及時，杜賓教官肯定會在泡普卡被命中之後衝著我來，要是那樣，我們就崩盤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"確有其事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點老兄在第一次實戰中的英雄氣概，在第二次實戰中的機智靈活，都差一點就讓我甘拜下風——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"月見夜，少說兩句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點他......心情不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"所以泡普卡還是告訴你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......為什麼大家突然不高興了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點哥哥，是泡普卡不該把漫畫的事告訴——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡，現在先不要說這個，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，聚餐！梓蘭姐，今天食堂人會不會很多啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，有我們心思縝密的梓蘭小姐在，就算再怎麼擁擠，我們也能在食堂佔據一席之地，我說得沒錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點哥哥，不要生氣......泡普卡錯了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天說過了，我沒生氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......有些話，不知道該不該說，沒想好該怎麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道該怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"就像——嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"月見夜，隨便講點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？終於，斑點你也需要從我頭腦的深井中汲取靈感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我頭一次聽人說自己的腦袋裡全是水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡，所謂“沒想好該怎麼說”，就相當於只想到了“呃”，還沒想到“腦袋裡全是水”。明白了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，等到了食堂，我會講清楚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，泡普卡沒做錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"那泡普卡可以把斑點哥哥的事蹟告訴大家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，說吧，泡普卡。你替我說了，我正好少說兩句。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點，看不出來，你以前竟然這麼厲害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"在敗軍之際收攏殘兵，讓二百人重新歸隊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然很不甘心，但我不得不說，這可是實打實讓我甘拜下風的戰績。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"被別人知道這種事，有什麼好不高興的？如果是我，我一定會將那枚勳章一直掛在胸前，向所有人展示我的英雄事蹟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒得到勳章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"他們沒給你授勳？多麼嚴重的失察行為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"因為......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斑點抓起麵包咬了一口。\n他以為自己會狠狠咬下去，然後在發力這一行為中得到一點勇氣。\n但他沒有。\n他下顎用力的方式與平時別無二致，從咀嚼到吞咽都順滑無比，連他自己都沒想到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我根本就沒收攏什麼殘兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"那個晚上，敵人攻來之後，我身邊很快就一個人也不剩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"我抓住機會從包圍中逃了出去，然後......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斑點幾乎是刻意地停了下來，喝了口果汁。\n他怕自己哽住，但他又多慮了。\n他曾經決定把這段經歷永遠隱藏下去。\n而此時此刻，他猛然發現，在這些朝夕相處的夥伴面前，瞞住不說才是更加困難的選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼逆反心理，也沒有什麼收攏殘兵，更沒有什麼授勳儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"我逃了，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"對於一個被全軍討厭的兵來說，逃走既符合大家的期待，又適合自己的性格。這叫適才適所，物盡其用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真跑上去假裝英雄，那才是不解風情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點，你也不必這麼說自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"梓蘭，你也是，你一定是覺得那樣的英雄事蹟和我對不上號，這才不想讓泡普卡告訴大家的，沒錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一陣沉默。\n對A6組來說，這樣的沉默頗為罕見。\n斑點環顧四周。\n泡普卡有些沮喪，月見夜則是一臉輕浮；梓蘭稍微有點緊張，不停用勺子攪咖啡，空爆還是一貫的坐沒坐相。\n這些人唯一的共同點是，斑點能從他們身上感受到絲毫不摻假的關切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你......畫了泡普卡說的那個漫畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"那支部隊其實蠢透了，當年我乖乖聽老頭子安排去那裡受罪，其實腦子裡的水不比現在的月見夜少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"軍官從來不把士兵當人看，每個月都有士兵因為過量訓練倒下，最後還要為了王酋之間毫無意義的摩擦流血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"要說那段經歷有什麼好處，大概只有炎熱的天氣吧。高溫把我腦子裡的水蒸幹了，讓我終於想到了逃。"},{"type":"narration","text":"但是......\n假如我不逃，會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"很長一段時間，我擺脫不了這個念頭，最終就有了那本自我美化的塗鴉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"畫的時候，我一度傻乎乎地幻想，要是當時沒跑，說不定老頭子會對我刮目相看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"......斑點老兄，恕我直言，以我對你這個人精準的認識，我可以斷言，這不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"月見夜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，讓他說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"很久很久以前，當我仍舊以東夜魔王的名號縱橫業界的時候，我曾有一位努力的同事，他以犀利的言辭聞名——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然只聽了個開頭，但我有種不祥的預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你這位同事因為什麼理由進了東國的軍隊，結果無論如何也適應不了，那可真是太令人扼腕歎息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"（訕笑）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你這個故事編得讓人一眼望到底，但至少中心思想沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你月見夜哪天成了公認的英雄，我大概會對人類的理性徹底失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是哪天我成了公認的英雄，我怕是要被人類的愚蠢嚇瘋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"說到底，我只是在家庭中耳濡目染，被灌輸了一個根本不適合自己的夢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，那本塗鴉畫到授勳就結束了，因為我貧瘠的想像力最多只能想到那一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"再往後，一個真成了英雄的博爾努該怎麼繼續他的英雄事蹟，我想破了頭也想不出來，因為那根本就是自相矛盾的產物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡，開始聽不懂了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"聽不懂也沒關係，等泡普卡長大了就會明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"可泡普卡，是不是做了壞事，讓斑點哥哥不得不說了不想說的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，多虧了泡普卡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"（撓頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"（眼神遊移）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"（尷尬地清嗓子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點哥哥，生病了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是生病哦，泡普卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"可斑點哥哥，看起來不太舒服......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"他在醞釀一些從出生開始從來沒說過的肉麻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"——月見夜，你想好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"——不，讚美的話，第一次跟別人說這種話總是很尷尬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"就算玲瓏剔透如我，在接待自己的首位客人時，也是手忙腳亂啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"你說是吧，斑點老兄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"月見夜，明天要不要約個一對一訓練？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我很樂意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我把剛才的話說完——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"——多虧了泡普卡，我才發現......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）......向最信任的人吐露這段可笑的“英雄事蹟”，似乎比一直藏著要更舒服一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，斑點老兄的意思是，我們已經是他最信任的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點，你現在要是想揍他，我沒有任何意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"梓蘭小姐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這句話被他一覆述還是一如既往地噁心，但是，看在內容沒錯的份上......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"這就對了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我提議，為了斑點今天給我們講的故事，乾杯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A6組組員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，假英雄的煽情故事到此為止——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"可斑點哥哥就是英雄嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點哥哥幫泡普卡擋住了攻擊，保護了大家，幫大家趕上了聚餐，斑點哥哥就是英雄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡要給斑點哥哥舉辦授勳儀式！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A6組組員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"授勳儀式上要有泡普卡，有梓蘭姐姐、空爆姐姐、月見夜哥哥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不行......人不夠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡再想想——對了，還有泡泡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，泡普卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"char_281_popka","isRemote":false,"text":"還有巫戀姐姐、鈴蘭姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"梓蘭、空爆，幫幫忙，我有預感，今天我們要有一場苦戰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"那我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"我打算跟食堂管理員說是你惹泡普卡鬧起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得你有權回宿舍，為自己的薪資哀悼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，斑點老兄，我來給你送件東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"給，這是泡普卡送你的“英雄證書”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄證書？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是磨破嘴皮，說服泡普卡放棄授勳儀式的傻念頭了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"回宿舍之後，泡普卡又有了新想法，這次誰也勸不住她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，這是她手繪的英雄證書，給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"她還要求我們在上面簽上自己的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"你們簽了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"現在就差你的啦。只要你把自己的名字簽上去，你就是A6組全員一致通過的英雄了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斑點沒有接話。\n他用兩手捧著那張“英雄證書”，上面寫著泡普卡能想出的最正式的“頒獎詞”，四周還畫著稚拙的裝飾畫和花邊。\n斑點把“頒獎詞”細細讀了一遍，然後，在手感厚實的紙張最下方，看到了四個人的簽名。\n他心裡一熱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，需不需要我借你一支高級鋼筆，好讓你的名字在其中顯得與眾不同？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斑點並未簽字，而是從儲物櫃裡拿出了一個精美的相框，將“英雄證書”裝飾在其中。\n他把相框放在床頭最顯眼的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不行，斑點老兄，你就這麼放棄簽字，泡普卡可是會鬧的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是怕泡普卡鬧，你是怕泡普卡一鬧起來，梓蘭就會找你麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"精準的判斷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"誇我也沒用，我是不會簽的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"和當英雄相比，還是現在的生活更適合我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，不說點什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是太感動，我終於用自己的真情融化了斑點老兄如同堅冰一般的心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......月見夜，我突然改主意了。英雄好像也不是特別難做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"下次再和你出任務的時候，我給你偷偷安排一個暴脾氣的姑娘讓你去搭訕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"等到你被揍得去醫務室躺上個十天半個月，到時候我就是整個A6組的英雄了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"二人相對大笑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_278_orchid","aliases":["梓蘭"]},{"speakerId":"char_281_popka","aliases":["泡普卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_282_catap","aliases":["空爆"]},{"speakerId":"char_283_midn","aliases":["月見夜"]},{"speakerId":"char_284_spot","aliases":["斑點","青年"]}]}
